<section class="admin-auth-card"><p class="kicker">First-run security</p><h1>Initialize Admin OS</h1><p>The setup key is stored outside the public web root at <code>storage/private-domain/admin/setup.key</code> unless <code>ATELIER_SETUP_KEY</code> is supplied by the server environment. v0.2.1 also requires <code>ATELIER_DATA_KEY</code> so the administrator identity store is encrypted at rest.</p><form class="admin-form" action="<?=e(url('/admin/setup'))?>" method="post"><?=csrf_field()?><label>Setup key<input name="setup_key" required autocomplete="off"></label><label>Name<input name="name" required></label><label>Email<input name="email" type="email" required></label><label>Password<input name="password" type="password" minlength="12" required><small>Minimum 12 characters.</small></label><button class="btn dark" type="submit">Create administrator</button></form><p class="admin-note"><a href="<?=e(url('/admin/login'))?>">Back to sign in</a></p></section>
